#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."

